  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Thinly slice brown onion and tomato.\n• Finely shred baby cos lettuce (see ingredients).\n• In a medium bowl, place haloumi and cover with water to soak.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6796ce8c183b5afa14503eaf-5027c8c4.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium heat. Cook onion, stirring regularly, until softened, 5-6 minutes.\n• Add the balsamic vinegar (for the onion), brown sugar and a splash of water. Mix well. Cook until dark and sticky, 3-5 minutes.\n• Transfer to a small bowl.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6796ce8c183b5afa14503eaf-9faf5e8c.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Cut corn in half.\n• Transfer corn to a large microwave-safe plate. Cover with a damp paper towel. Microwave\n• corn on high, until tender, 4-5 minutes.\n• Drain any excess liquid. Season with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6796ce8c183b5afa14503eaf-13348552.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Drain haloumi and pat dry. Cut haloumi into 1cm-thick slices.\n• Wash and dry frying pan, then return to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• When oil is hot, cook haloumi, in batches, until golden, 1-2 minutes each side.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6796ce8c183b5afa14503eaf-04d16e32.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, halve bake-at-home burger buns and bake directly on a wire rack in the oven, until heated through, 2-3 minutes.\n• Reserve a handful of cos lettuce for the burgers, then place the rest in a second medium bowl.\n• Add the balsamic vinegar (for the salad) and a drizzle of olive oil. Toss to coat. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6796ce8c183b5afa14503eaf-6cca6a75.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Spread bun bases with creamy pesto dressing.\n• Top with reserved lettuce, tomato slices, hearty haloumi and caramelised onion.\n• Serve with corn cob and salad. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6796ce8c183b5afa14503eaf-ff14a4de.jpeg"
    }
  ]
